                        "review": "Indie horror game centred on exploration, gathering clues and uncovering a mysterious story in a dark setting\n\n✅Atmospheric horror vibe (dark rooms, sound effects)\n✅The graphics are good for a horror game\n✅The game manages to scare you\n✅Notes to collect\n✅Interactive environment\n\n❌Poorly implemented mechanics, e.g. the torch system (instead of a single torch, you have several ‘consumable’ torches) and doors that get stuck\n❌There is no option to adjust the sound in the game\n❌Price is too high\n❌Some items cannot be picked up\n\n✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike] , [strike] Bad [/strike] , [strike] Mediocre [/strike] , [b] Decent [/b] , [strike] Good [/strike] , [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested game)\n\n[quote] If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI’m happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
